abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact native real-to-C3 coordinate crosswalk,
  enriched TFVD and Green transport, and the global relational bracket route.
  Version 0.3.0 adds the multiplicity-independent analytic-order reduction,
  the canonical finite C3 spectral certificate, the exact no-go theorem for
  the raw positive scalar Cauchy readout, and the polarized two-variable raw
  C3 Green--gamma identity, while retaining the completed trace identity as
  an explicit open gate.
